					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400661702,
					"content": "哈哈，也算是规律使然。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400661703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "枫原万叶"
				},
				{
					"id": 400661703,
					"content": "我们又进了幻境里的迷宫哦，不过这一次，似乎跟上次不太一样呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400661704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400661704,
					"content": "讲述了这一次的见闻…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400661705
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400661705,
					"content": "人气变淡，摆设也不那么华丽了…嗯，本该如此。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400661706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "枫原万叶"
				},
				{
					"id": 400661706,
					"content": "你们见到的，应该是正在没落的枫原家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400661707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "枫原万叶"
				},
				{
					"id": 400661707,
					"content": "不过，幻境里的你像个影子一样，而且跟现在不太一样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400661708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400661708,
					"content": "没错，本皇女也赞同。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400661709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲谢尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 400661709,
					"content": "与现在的万叶卿相比，那道幻影有更多迷茫，背负着沉重的命运。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400661710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奥兹"
				},
				{
					"id": 400661710,
					"content": "确实能算是背负着沉重的命运。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400661711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400661711,
					"content": "说明如今的我成长了。让各位见到不成熟的我，实在抱歉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400661712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "枫原万叶"
				},
				{
					"id": 400661712,
					"content": "离开稻妻之后很长一段时间里，我的生活颠沛流离。但不是坏事，我因而沉淀了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400661713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "枫原万叶"
				},
				{
					"id": 400661713,
					"content": "如果我也能见到那个从前的我就好了。他见了我，定会明白的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400661714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "枫原万叶"
				},
				{
					"id": 400661714,
					"content": "——人生路远，我仍需远行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "枫原万叶"
				}
			]
